  "changes": [
    "Replace two per-position 16-byte stack/block copies with alias-safe scalar 4-byte loads/stores. Keep identical classification, finite-range guards, fallback and exact snapshot bits.",
    "The built DDraw disassembly contains 205 REP MOVS sites versus 207 before; the two removed sites were inside per-vertex paths.",
